# ⚠️ DEPRECATED - Server folder is no longer used
# 
# This project now uses Vercel Serverless Functions exclusively.
# All API endpoints are in /api/ directory and deploy to Vercel.
# 
# The following environment variables are now configured in Vercel Dashboard:
# 
# Required:
#   FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_finnhub_api_key_here
# 
# Optional:
#   ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-frontend-domain.com
#   RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS=30
#   RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=1000
#   CACHE_TTL_QUOTE=10
#   CACHE_TTL_STATIC=60
#   CACHE_TTL_NEWS=10
#   LOG_LEVEL=info
# 
# Vercel KV (Redis) is automatically provisioned when you add the integration
# in Vercel Dashboard → Storage → Create Database → KV
# 
# The old Express server (proxy.js) is kept for reference only.
# It is NOT deployed and NOT needed for production.